  "description": "The write buffer and the durability log, side by side. The commitlog row shows what every write pays for durability and distinguishes a slow disk from a full commitlog. The memtable row shows what is buffered before a flush, and how often that flush happens.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
